      "textEN": "Hello! How are you?",
      "textCN": "你好！你好吗？"
    },
    {
      "textEN": "I am fine, thank you.",
      "textCN": "我很好，谢谢你。"
    },
    {
      "textEN": "This is my little brother, Luigi.",
      "textCN": "这是我的弟弟，路易吉。"
    },
    {
      "textEN": "Nice to meet you.",
      "textCN": "很高兴认识你。"
    },
    {
      "textEN": "I am from China.",
      "textCN": "我来自中国。"
    },
    {
      "textEN": "Where are you from?",
      "textCN": "你来自哪里？"
    },
    {
